#ASSERT `the event exclusions on the plain policy for` (`a collision with the load` (`carrying` 0 `, persons counting children` 2 `, not counting them` 2 `, speed over the limit` (JUST (50%)))) EQUALS EMPTY

-- 12.22, src:698-701: proven untruthful or forged; an omission unless inadvertent.
#ASSERT `the event exclusions on the plain policy for` (`a plain collision where` (LIST `fact 12.22 proven untruthful`)) EQUALS LIST `12.22 untruthful or forged claim information`
#ASSERT `the event exclusions on the plain policy for` (`a plain collision where` (LIST `fact 12.22 important information omitted`)) EQUALS LIST `12.22 untruthful or forged claim information`
#ASSERT `the event exclusions on the plain policy for` (`a plain collision where` (LIST `fact 12.22 important information omitted`, `fact 12.22 the omission was inadvertent`)) EQUALS EMPTY

-- Two exclusions at once are both reported, in Article 12's order.
#ASSERT `the event exclusions on the plain policy for` (`a plain collision where` (LIST `fact 12.9 outside Vietnam`, `fact 12.4 over the alcohol limit`)) EQUALS LIST `12.4 alcohol or drugs`, `12.9 outside Vietnam`

