§§ `The 2019 version`

-- A contract concluded before 28/03/2022 is under the rules as made in 2019 (fork F1). Listing
-- BS03 then asks for a clause whose 2019 text the file does not hold: declined.
`the 2019 policy with BS03` MEANS `a 2026 policy on` `the private car` `, concluded on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, insured for` 600_000_000 `, market value` (JUST 600_000_000) `, with` (LIST `clause accepted and paid in full and on time:` `BS03 flood damage`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `11.1 — the peril is one the cover lists, on` `the 2019 policy with BS03` `for` (`a loss by` `driving into flood water` `, items` EMPTY) BECAUSE "the text of a supplementary clause other than BS01 in force before Decision 17/2022 is not in the document"
#ASSERT `11.1 — the peril is one the cover lists, on` `the 2019 policy with BS03` `for` `the plain collision`
